/v1/","context":{"app_id":1769140,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-1769140-1846651706691309","game_id":"steam-1769140","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is LIVE — Play the MIRAI #167 Demo (Version 2.0 Out Now!)","summary":"We are thrilled to officially announce that MIRAI #167 is participating in this edition of Steam Next Fest! Starting right now, our brand-new Demo Version 2.0 is available to download and play for free throughout the festival. We have taken your previous feedback and delivered major overhauls and quality-of-life improvements across the board. What's New In Version 2.0?Added complete Japanese localization 🇯🇵 (日本語対応) so more players can jump straight into the action.Fixed an issue where changing l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691309","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1769140-1827626365768053","game_id":"steam-1769140","kind":"announcement","title":"MIRAI #167 was nominated for the Tokyo Indie Games Summit Award 2026!","summary":"We are thrilled to share that MIRAI #167 was nominated for the category \"Andrenaline Rush\" at the Tokyo Indie Games Summit Award 2026! It was an honor to be recognized by the jury and to stand alongside other amazing projects. We want to send a huge congratulations to \"Onikura\" for taking home the award in our category - it was well deserved! Last weekend (March 20th-21st), we were also part of the festival's Official Selection in Koenji, Tokyo. We hope everyone who tried our game had a great ti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-25T12:45:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365768053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1769140-1826362059925662","game_id":"steam-1769140","kind":"announcement","title":"MIRAI #167 is in the Women Day's Sale 2026!","summary":"We're excited to share our participation in the Women Day's Sale 2026, organized by Wings. This sale celebrates must-play games made by women and gender marginalized-led teams! A special shout-out for Rita, our amazing artist and visionary. She is responsible for much of the incredible work you see today in MIRAI #167, and the very core of the game's story, art and concept was born from her vision. Take a look into all the other selected incredible games here: https://store.steampowered.com/sale","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-06T22:05:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059925662","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1769140-1818752592128561","game_id":"steam-1769140","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Now Available!","summary":"We're excited to announce the official release of our demo! Experience what it feels like to save humanity from AI in MIRAI #167, ahead of the full release! About the DemoIn this demo, you will have a glimpse of the first two chapters of the game, including 2 levels, 1 boss fight, 1 mini-game, and several cutscenes that introduce the story and the universe. The full release is planned for the first half of 2026 — stay tuned! The demo is currently localized into English, Portuguese (Brasil), Port","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-12T19:22:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592128561","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1769140-1818118366176095","game_id":"steam-1769140","kind":"announcement","title":"MIRAI #167 Demo coming to Steam on December 12th!","summary":"Save humanity from AI when the MIRAI #167 demo lands on December 12th! Control two characters at once, rewinding time and jumping through portals in this innovative 2D pixel-art runner. Upgrade your characters, break records and rewrite history before it's too late! Watch again our Demo Announce Trailer and don't forget to wishlist the game ahead of next year's full release!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-05T11:51:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366176095","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1769140-1815034433032003","game_id":"steam-1769140","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Playtest + DevGamm Awards 2025","summary":"MIRAI #167 is one of the nominees for Best Game from Portugal at the DevGamm Awards 2025!We'll be featured at the DevGamm Awards ceremony on November 7th at 18:00 UTC, competing for ‘Best Game from Portugal’ among an incredible lineup of nominees - you can check them all out here! We'll also be in Lisbon on that same day, showcasing our Demo. If fou're nearby or planning to visit, come meet us and play the Demo in person.And that's not all - our first Steam Playtest is now open!We're inviting pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-04T12:01:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815034433032003","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1769140-1813674389043244","game_id":"steam-1769140","kind":"announcement","title":"MIRAI #167 is nominated for Best Portuguese Game at IndieX 2025!","summary":"MIRAI #167 is one of the nominees for Best Portuguese Game by APVP at IndieX 2025! As nominees and part of the IndieX 2025 showcase, our game will be played live tomorrow, October 20th at 16:00 CET on the RTP Arena Twitch Channel. We'll also be joining the stream for a short interview. Tune in for an exclusive first look at our demo, releasing very, very soon on Steam! A huge thanks to IndieX and APVP for including us in this amazing event and for the nomination. Make sure to also check out the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-19T18:38:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813674389043244","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1769140-1813674388901381","game_id":"steam-1769140","kind":"announcement","title":"MIRAI #167 is heading to SXSW Sydney 2025!","summary":"MIRAI #167 is going overseas for the first time! We're thrilled to announce that our game has been selected for the SXSW Sydney Games Festival, taking place from October 15th to 18th.If you're around or planning to visit Sydney, Australia, come play our demo! Our game will be showcased on the following dates:Thursday, October 16th - 10am to 6pm - Booth 07Saturday, October 18th - 10am to 5pm - Booth 03A huge thanks to SXSW Sydney for including us and don't forget to check out all the other amazin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-15T10:48:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813674388901381","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1769140-1807332909579024","game_id":"steam-1769140","kind":"announcement","title":"MIRAI #167 is in Tiny Teams!","summary":"We're excited to share that 'MIRAI #167' is part of Tiny Teams 2025! It's a real honor to be included in such an important festival and we would like to thank all the team at 'Yogscast Games' for making this possible.Take a look into all the selected (and great!) indie games here: https://store.steampowered.com/sale/TinyTeams2025. 👀 We would like also to announce that a brand-new trailer and a public demo are coming very soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-07T18:31:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909579024","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1769140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:13Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-1769140":"2026-10-25T23:59:13Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"1769140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"3861660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-1769140","app_id":1769140,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:06Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"de0a8b0c1601033efaac7a045072a042c9b2c00a3a7eed95dece373d99aa7033","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"MIRAI #167 is a 2D pixel-art runner where you control two characters at once, rewinding time and jumping through portals. Embark on a frantic adventure to save humanity as AI